        "title": "FRANKLIN & MICHAEL REUNITE! Playthrough with Ned Luke (Live) 🎮🔥",
        "description": "You asked for it, and we finally made it happen. Franklin Clinton and Michael De Santa are BACK together in the same room!\n\nFor this stream, I sat down with my brother Ned Luke for an epic live playthrough of Grand Theft Auto V. It’s been over a decade since we recorded these characters, and today we are looking back at the missions, roasting each other's gameplay, and sharing some stories from the motion capture stage.\n\nPull up a chair, grab some snacks, and let’s take it back to Los Santos!\n\nDon't forget to smash that LIKE button, SUBSCRIBE if you’re new to the channel, and hit the notification bell so you never miss another stream! 💯\n\nFollow My Socials:👉 Instagram | TikTok | X | Kick: @Shawn_Fonteno\n\nBusiness Inquiries: fontenogirl@gmail.com\n\n#GTAV #ShawnFonteno #NedLuke #FranklinAndMichael #GrandTheftAuto #GamingLive",
