        "title": "Shawn \"Solo\" Fonteno: Back & Better! 📹",
        "description": "What’s up everybody, it’s your boy Shawn \"Solo\" Fonteno—aka the voice and face of Franklin Clinton.\n\nI’ve been quiet for a minute, but I’m BACK, healthier, focused, and better than ever before. In this video, I wanted to sit down and catch you up on where my head is at. \n\nBut to know where you're going, you gotta remember where you came from. Today, I'm taking you on a personal walk down memory lane. We're heading back to the streets that raised me, reflecting on the crazy journey of making gaming history, and talking about the lessons that kept me grounded through it all.\n\nThank you to the best fanbase in the world for always riding with me. The legacy continues.\n\nHit that SUBSCRIBE button, turn on notifications, and drop a comment below letting me know your favorite Franklin Clinton moment! 💯\n\nFollow My Socials:👉 Instagram | TikTok | X | Kick: @Shawn_Fonteno\n\nBusiness Inquiries: fontenogirl@gmail.com\n\n#ShawnFonteno #GTAV #FranklinClinton #BackAndBetter #MemoryLane #Solo",
